    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as Kara, the unexpected heir to Gin\u2019s Gunstore. With your team by your side, learn the ropes and turn the shop into a booming business.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/14cec6f44235209d225562cfdcdb6203.avif?t=1753079755\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/2c710eeca1fe1abfce6dc8a41632b58d.avif?t=1753079755\" width=616 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer comes with a story\u2014and an angle. It's up to you to read between the lines,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fine-tune weapon stats to suit their needs, and guide each deal to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Price smart. Bluff harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or leave it all to luck and see where the dice fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no single path to success\u2014find your own way to make it big.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/d088aa9160566085c86875bac52b4794.avif?t=1753079755\" width=616 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true merchant sees more than junk and gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down old gear to salvage rare parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot hidden gems buried in piles of scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills to turn scrap into one-of-a-kind guns\u2014custom builds that sell for top dollar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/e9b97a77f6445eb06cfcff9693d21363.avif?t=1753079755\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/a5d1da11807d3cd1ccc991cd622d6a31.avif?t=1753079755\" width=616 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are they here to buy\u2014 or to spy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this store, you'll cross paths with all kinds of people. It may start at the workbench, but your story goes far beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your crew, hone your skills, and uncover the stories that walk through your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always one more mystery waiting to unfold.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as Kara, the unexpected heir to Gin\u2019s Gunstore. With your team by your side, learn the ropes and turn the shop into a booming business.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/14cec6f44235209d225562cfdcdb6203.avif?t=1753079755\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/2c710eeca1fe1abfce6dc8a41632b58d.avif?t=1753079755\" width=616 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every customer comes with a story\u2014and an angle. It's up to you to read between the lines,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fine-tune weapon stats to suit their needs, and guide each deal to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Price smart. Bluff harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or leave it all to luck and see where the dice fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no single path to success\u2014find your own way to make it big.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/d088aa9160566085c86875bac52b4794.avif?t=1753079755\" width=616 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true merchant sees more than junk and gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break down old gear to salvage rare parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot hidden gems buried in piles of scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills to turn scrap into one-of-a-kind guns\u2014custom builds that sell for top dollar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/e9b97a77f6445eb06cfcff9693d21363.avif?t=1753079755\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728470/extras/a5d1da11807d3cd1ccc991cd622d6a31.avif?t=1753079755\" width=616 height=110 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are they here to buy\u2014 or to spy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this store, you'll cross paths with all kinds of people. It may start at the workbench, but your story goes far beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your crew, hone your skills, and uncover the stories that walk through your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always one more mystery waiting to unfold.</p>",
